{
  "cues": [
    {
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 3.1273,
      "text": "In 1991, roofs began collapsing miles"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 3.2,
      "end_seconds": 4.6545,
      "text": "from a volcano in the Philippines."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 5.1636,
      "end_seconds": 7.1273,
      "text": "No lava had reached them. So"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 7.2,
      "end_seconds": 9.2364,
      "text": "what was crushing the buildings? Mount"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 9.3091,
      "end_seconds": 11.8545,
      "text": "Pinatubo had erupted, throwing volcanic ash"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 12.0,
      "end_seconds": 14.0364,
      "text": "high into the sky. That same"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 14.1091,
      "end_seconds": 16.0727,
      "text": "day, a typhoon swept across the"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 16.2545,
      "end_seconds": 18.2545,
      "text": "region. Its winds spread the ash."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 18.6545,
      "end_seconds": 20.9455,
      "text": "Its rain soaked it. Volcanic ash"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 21.0182,
      "end_seconds": 22.2545,
      "text": "is made of tiny pieces of"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 22.4,
      "end_seconds": 24.0727,
      "text": "rock and glass. As the wet"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 24.1455,
      "end_seconds": 25.8909,
      "text": "ash piled up on rooftops, the"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 26.0,
      "end_seconds": 27.2,
      "text": "weight grew too much for some"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 27.2727,
      "end_seconds": 29.4545,
      "text": "buildings. At Clark Air Base, about"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 29.5273,
      "end_seconds": 31.5636,
      "text": "twelve miles from the volcano, roofs"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 31.6364,
      "end_seconds": 33.5273,
      "text": "buckled under the load. In nearby"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 33.7091,
      "end_seconds": 35.9273,
      "text": "towns, buildings were damaged too. The"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 36.1091,
      "end_seconds": 37.8182,
      "text": "danger had travelled through the air,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 37.8909,
      "end_seconds": 39.7818,
      "text": "settled above people's heads, and turned"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 39.8182,
      "end_seconds": 41.2364,
      "text": "the rain into an extra weight"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 41.3455,
      "end_seconds": 42.4727,
      "text": "their roofs could not hold."
    }
  ]
}